    "detailed_description": "<h1>Kickstarter is live!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider helping us finish development on the game by supporting our kickstarter! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The link to our page is under &quot;visit the website&quot; on the sidebar!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed and built by a team of veterans from Activision, WB Games, Crytek, Epic and Guerilla Games, ANIMO Stars Arena is a game that blends adorable animal pilots with ridiculously powerful mech juggernauts, in epic battles and evolving battlescapes that will keep you constantly rebuilding your loadouts and hangar of fully customized war machines!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/77f68994ac62d59ccb2b1ee4b0f3beac.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR MECH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ANIMO is composed of a: Cabin, Engine, Bumper, and 2 weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own mech war machines and wreak havoc in multiple battlescapes. Choose traversal engines spanning treads, hovercraft, spider legs, wheels and more, and pair them with dozens of cabins and bumpers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then finish off your personalized mech with a host of special weapons like grappling hooks, flamethrower, sniper rifle, lasers, and more to manifest your own incredibly cute and powerful mechs of annihilation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/cd040f69c025cd2ba7ef3e21a4038ed1.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/ed8672e4518868217989c4d3ead11216.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PAINT YOUR ANIMO!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of paint themes and skins for your mech!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/971f835f4ff37cf0c0209bc1e3db9f83.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PILOT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pilot represents who you are. Choose your favorite pilot whether that\u2019s a cute cuddly puppy, a fierce bird, or a slithering snake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/7b2e0986022980ebd5bb6b842443093f.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/91b7bed07b3ef9628a0d667bdd0c3358.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR FAVORITE GAME MODE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on board your ANIMO and battle other players across different game modes including team deathmatch, battle royale, capture the flag and more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/c0b8ce0e88419eea6582900b32e3df3e.poster.avif?t=1749525024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/c0b8ce0e88419eea6582900b32e3df3e.webm?t=1749525024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/c0b8ce0e88419eea6582900b32e3df3e.mp4?t=1749525024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed and built by a team of veterans from Activision, WB Games, Crytek, Epic and Guerilla Games, ANIMO Stars Arena is a game that blends adorable animal pilots with ridiculously powerful mech juggernauts, in epic battles and evolving battlescapes that will keep you constantly rebuilding your loadouts and hangar of fully customized war machines!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/77f68994ac62d59ccb2b1ee4b0f3beac.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR MECH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ANIMO is composed of a: Cabin, Engine, Bumper, and 2 weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own mech war machines and wreak havoc in multiple battlescapes. Choose traversal engines spanning treads, hovercraft, spider legs, wheels and more, and pair them with dozens of cabins and bumpers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then finish off your personalized mech with a host of special weapons like grappling hooks, flamethrower, sniper rifle, lasers, and more to manifest your own incredibly cute and powerful mechs of annihilation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/cd040f69c025cd2ba7ef3e21a4038ed1.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/ed8672e4518868217989c4d3ead11216.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PAINT YOUR ANIMO!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of paint themes and skins for your mech!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/971f835f4ff37cf0c0209bc1e3db9f83.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PILOT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pilot represents who you are. Choose your favorite pilot whether that\u2019s a cute cuddly puppy, a fierce bird, or a slithering snake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/7b2e0986022980ebd5bb6b842443093f.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/91b7bed07b3ef9628a0d667bdd0c3358.avif?t=1749525024\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR FAVORITE GAME MODE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on board your ANIMO and battle other players across different game modes including team deathmatch, battle royale, capture the flag and more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/c0b8ce0e88419eea6582900b32e3df3e.poster.avif?t=1749525024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/c0b8ce0e88419eea6582900b32e3df3e.webm?t=1749525024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/c0b8ce0e88419eea6582900b32e3df3e.mp4?t=1749525024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
